//    vertices; the same model twice: neither). Drawn together, the coarser is drawn a little farther in
//    depth; of the same model twice, the one the player's room shows stays and the other is hidden.
//  kStandins: pieces at least 75% covered by finer pieces' surfaces, nothing over 3% of them farther than 1 m
